<title>USA: Gibraltar SD, Mich., won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Gibraltar SD, Mich., won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc. said it won $7.710 million of Gibraltar SD, Mich., general obligation 1996 judgment bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.98 percent.</p>
